Preserve actual [[Get]] presence through proxy forwarding.

The existing native and scripted-proxy get algorithms optionally report their
lookup result. Trap lookup, execution, validation and ordering stay original.
No HasProperty/descriptor preflight or second trap lookup is introduced.

